      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'DIG-DUG

    Release year: 1982


    In Dig-Dug, the player controls
    the titular Dig-Dug, and must clear out each level of Pookas and Fygars. They
    do this by digging tunnels to reach them, and attatching an air pump to blow
    them up. However, the enemies can dig through the dirt as well, and can''t be
    attacked as they do.


    The Pookas here use their ability to dig to pass through
    other enemies and hazards as if they aren''t even there. However, they do need
    to be careful of falling tetronimoes - just like the boulders in Dig-Dug, the
    tetronimoes can squash the Pookas!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
