  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'PAC-MAN

    Release year: 1980


    In Pac-Man, the player controls
    the iconic Pac-Man around a maze, avoiding ghosts and collecting pellets to advance
    to higher levels. To get more points, the player can eat the fruits (and other
    objects) which spawn near the ghost house.


    There are 8 ''fruits'' which
    Pac-Man can eat on his adventures - but only 7 can be found in this game: The
    Cherry, Strawberry, Orange, Apple, Watermelon, Bell, and Key. Do you know which
    one is missing?


    The Galaxian Flagship! The Galaxian is originally from
    its own game, so was not included as a Pac-Man fruit in this one - but may appear
    as an enemy in a later update.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
